eQFAo9z24FM",content:"Discover how to take your AI-generated designs to the next level. Learn advanced prompting techniques, post-processing methods, and design refinement strategies to create stunning, professional designs that stand out.",duration:"18:30",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Intermediate",topics:["AI Design","Design Improvement","Advanced Prompting","Design Refinement","Professional Polish"]},{id:"aura-image-to-html",title:"Image to HTML with AI",description:"Transform your design workflow with AI tools and free resources! Learn how to convert screenshots into HTML, make quick edits, and export directly to Figma.",videoUrl:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ItsKfNAoqTU",content:"Transform your design workflow with AI tools and free resources! Learn how to convert screenshots into HTML, make quick edits, and export directly to Figma—all while using free design kits and creative platforms like UIVerse, Dribbble, Layers, and Lapa Ninja. Discover how to use AI to generate HTML from screenshots, make fast edits with simple prompts, export designs to Figma seamlessly, and access free resources like the Aura UI Kit.",duration:"21:22",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Beginner",topics:["AI Design","Screenshot to HTML","Free Resources","Figma Export","UIVerse","Design Workflow"],chapters:[{time:"0:00",title:"Intro: Why AI is a game-changer for designers"},{time:"0:10",title:"The secret tool for converting screenshots to HTML"},{time:"0:29",title:"Creating unique layouts with AI"},{time:"0:48",title:"Adding animations and customizing designs"},{time:"1:05",title:"Quick edits using prompts for fonts, colors, and themes"},{time:"2:03",title:"Using UIVerse to replace buttons & cards in projects"},{time:"2:35",title:"Exporting designs to Figma"},{time:"3:30",title:"Leveraging free resources for inspiration and workflow"},{time:"5:00",title:"How to access and use the Aura UI Kit"},{time:"6:00",title:"Final thoughts on combining creativity and AI"}],resources:[{name:"Free Aura UI K