animations, convert images to HTML instantly, use design references effectively, master manual editing techniques, and create beautiful mockups and presentations. Discover how to avoid 'AI slop' and maintain design quality while leveraging AI's speed.",duration:"31:03",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Intermediate",topics:["AI Design","GPT 5.1","Landing Pages","Image to HTML","References","Mockups","Design Quality","Workflow"],chapters:[{time:"00:00",title:"Introduction to GPT 5.1 speed and capabilities"},{time:"02:50",title:"Creating a basic landing page with a simple prompt"},{time:"04:08",title:"Image to HTML conversion demonstration"},{time:"09:46",title:"Using component references from the start"},{time:"13:01",title:"Manual editing techniques and best practices"},{time:"19:11",title:"Canvas feature and presentation modes"},{time:"26:55",title:"Philosophy on AI design tools and avoiding 'AI slop'"}],resources:[{name:"Aura",url:"https://aura.build"},{name:"mymind",url:"https://mymind.com"},{name:"Dribbble",url:"https://dribbble.com"},{name:"Lapa Ninja",url:"https://www.lapa.ninja"},{name:"Solar Icons",url:"https://icon-sets.iconify.design/solar/"},{name:"Tailwind CSS",url:"https://tailwindcss.com"},{name:"Lovable",url:"https://lovable.dev"},{name:"v0 by Vercel",url:"https://v0.dev"},{name:"Cursor",url:"https://cursor.sh"},{name:"Figma",url:"https://www.figma.com"}]},{id:"gemini-3-changes-everything",title:"Gemini 3 Changes Everything for Web Design",description:"We're living in the golden era for AI-powered web design. Gemini 3 represents a quantum leap in capability—learn the three most powerful techniques for getting production-ready designs.",videoUrl:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b-kTkak2FKs",content:"We're living in what I call the 'golden era' for AI-powered web design. Gemini 3 represents a quantum leap in capability—it handles complex layouts, produces polished typography, and generates animations that typically trip up other models. Learn how to build an inspiration library, master the image-to-HTML workflow, edit and refine with Aura's design tools, add sophisticated animations, build consistent sections, polish with assets, and export anywhere.",duration:"28:45",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Intermediate",topics:["AI Design","Gemini 3","Image to HTML","Design Workflow","Inspiration Library","Animations","Design Tools","Export"],chapters:[{time:"00:00",title:"Introduction: The golden era of AI web design"},{time:"02:15",title:"Stop creating generic designs"},{time:"05:30",title:"Technique 1: Build an inspiration library"},{time:"10:20",title:"Technique 2: Master the image-to-HTML workflow"},{time:"15:45",title:"Technique 3: Edit, refine, and elevate with Aura"},{time:"20:10",title:"Adding sophisticated animations without code"},{time:"23:30",title:"Building new sections consistently"},{time:"25:00",title:"Polish with assets and backgrounds"},{time:"26:20",title:"Export and deploy anywhere"}],resources:[{name:"Aura",url:"https://aura.build"},{name:"Mobbin",url:"https://mobbin.com"},{name:"Dribbble",url:"https://dribbble.com"},{name:"Unicorn Studio",url:"https://www.unicorn.studio"},{name:"mymind",url:"https://mymind.com"},{name:"UI Verse",url:"https://uiverse.io"},{name:"21st.dev",url:"https://21st.dev"},{name:"Aura Components",url:"https://www.aura.build/components"}]}],l=[{id:"turn-generic-ai-layouts-short",title:"Turn Generic AI Layouts into Beautiful UI",description:"Quick tips for transforming generic AI layouts into beautiful UI with better prompting and assets.",videoUrl:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/A3R-PyetupE",content:"Learn quick techniques to turn generic AI-generated layouts into beautiful, professional UI designs using better prompting strategies and high-quality assets.",duration:"0:60",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Beginner",topics:["AI Design","Quick Tips","Prompting","UI Assets"]},{id:"transform-ai-designs-short",title:"Transform AI-Generated Designs",description:"Transform AI-Generated designs with better colors, fonts, and customization techniques.",videoUrl:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/H0vRMcTZdtU",content:"Discover how to transform basic AI-generated designs into polished, professional layouts using strategic color choices, typography improvements, and smart customization techniques.",duration:"0:60",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Beginner",topics:["AI Design","Typography","Color Theory","Customization"]},{id:"add-3d-video-assets-short",title:"How to add 3D and video assets to your AI designs",description:"Learn how to upgrade your AI-generated designs in Aura with powerful 3D, video, and image assets all in just a few clicks!",videoUrl:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9VOY0azQ1F8",content:"Learn how to upgrade your AI-generated designs in Aura with powerful 3D, video, and image assets all in just a few clicks! Start with the New Assets feature to insert animated backgrounds from Spline presets, import your own Spline project via custom URL, or browse stunning Unsplash images sorted by theme and color. Want to go further? Add a video link to create a dynamic, eye-catching background.",duration:"0:60",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Beginner",topics:["AI Design","3D Assets","Video Backgrounds","Spline","Unsplash"]},{id:"convert-figma-short",title:"Convert AI-Generated designs from into clean, editable Figma files",description:"Learn how to convert your AI-generated designs into clean, editable Figma files for seamless design workflows.",videoUrl:"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JyUltZ5bqvg",content:"Learn how to upgrade your AI-generated designs in Aura with powerful 3D, video, and image assets all in just a few clicks! Start with the New Assets feature to insert animated backgrounds from Spline presets, import your own Spline project via custom URL, or browse stunning Unsplash images sorted by theme and color. Want to go further? Add a video link to create a dynamic, eye-catching background.",duration:"0:60",instructor:"Meng To",level:"Beginner",topics:["AI Design","Fi