<!-- AI INSTRUCTION: This image has multiple resolutions available (${a}). Choose the appropriate resolution based on the design context:
- Use 320w for thumbnails, icons, or small images
- Use 800w for medium-sized images in content areas
- Use 1600w (default) for large hero images or full-width sections
