:"Cormorant",body:"Plex Serif",headingSecondary:"Playfair Display"},description:"Use Cormorant for hero headings, Playfair Display for secondary heading moments, and Plex Serif for premium editorial body rhythm."},{id:"expressive-grotesk",label:"Bricolage + Manrope",preview:"Heading Bricolage / Body Manrope",typography:{heading:"Bricolage Grotesque",body:"Manrope"},description:"Use Bricolage Grotesque for expressive product headings and Manrope for polished body and UI copy. Keep shapes confident, modern, and slightly playful."},{id:"classic-editorial",label:"Playfair + DM Sans",preview:"Heading Playfair / Body DM Sans",typography:{heading:"Playfair Display",body:"DM Sans",headingSecondary:"Instrument Serif"},description:"Use Playfair Display for elegant primary headings, Instrument Serif for refined pull quotes or subheads, and DM Sans for readable body copy."},{id:"plex-editorial",label:"Plex Serif + Plex Sans",preview:"Heading Plex Serif / Body Plex Sans",typography:{heading:"IBM Plex Serif",body:"IBM Plex Sans",headingSecondary:"IBM Plex Mono"},description:"Use IBM Plex Serif for structured editorial headings, IBM Plex Mono for precise secondary labels, and IBM Plex Sans for durable interface copy."},{id:"condensed-impact",label:"Oswald + Work Sans",preview:"Heading Oswald / Body Work Sans",typography:{heading:"Oswald",body:"Work Sans"},description:"Use Oswald for compact, high-impact headings and Work Sans for steady body and UI copy. Keep hierarchy bold without making paragraphs feel compressed."}],Ors=[{id:"graphite-lime",label:"Graphite Lime",swatches:["#111113","#2f3330","#d9ff63","#f7f4ea"],description:"Use charcoal surfaces, warm off-white text areas, and a sharp lime accent only for important actions and highlights."},{id:"porcelain-cobalt",label:"Porcelain Cobalt",swatches:["#f8f7f2","#e1ded5","#1558d6","#101828"],description:"Use porcelain neutrals, deep ink text, restrained cobalt accents, and soft cool-gray borders for a precise product feel."},{id:"ink-coral",label:"Ink Coral",swatches:["#0d1117","#202832","#ff6b5f","#f4efe7"],description:"Use dark ink backgrounds, muted panels, coral accents, and warm light text for a cinematic but usable interface."},{id:"olive-paper",label:"Olive Paper",swatches:["#fbf7ec","#d7d1b8","#61724d","#1d2018"],description:"Use paper-like warm neutrals, muted olive accents, and dark botanical text. Keep contrast calm and tactile."},{id:"sage-graphite",label:"Sage Graphite",swatches:["#eef6ef","#b8d8c4","#2f6f5e","#111917"],description:"Use pale sage surfaces, graphite text, and grounded green accents for a calm technical interface with organic warmth."},{id:"amber-slate",label:"Amber Slate",swatches:["#111827","#27303f","#f59e0b","#f8fafc"],description:"Use slate surfaces, crisp light typography, and amber highlights for alert states, metrics, and decisive product actions."},{id:"rose-quartz",label:"Rose Quartz",swatches:["#fff7f8","#f3c6d3","#9f3a55","#24181d"],description:"Use soft quartz backgrounds, muted rose accents, and deep plum text for polished editorial interfaces with warmth."},{id:"aqua-carbon",label:"Aqua Carbon",swatches:["#05070a","#101820","#22d3ee","#e6fffb"],description:"Use carbon-black panels, luminous aqua accents, and cool mint highlights for precise futuristic dashboards and tools."}],Prs=[{id:"compact",label:"Compact",preview:"4 / 8 / 12",description:"Use a dense 4px-based spacing rhythm for tools and dashboards. Keep controls close, readable, and aligned."},{id:"balanced",label:"Balanced",preview:"8 / 16 / 24",description:"Use an 8px spacing rhythm with moderate gaps, comfortable cards, and consistent section padding."},{id:"editorial",label:"Editorial",preview:"16 / 32 / 64",description:"Use generous editorial spacing with strong section breaks, large negative space, and deliberate content groupings."}],Drs=[{id:"crisp",label:"Crisp",preview:"2-4px",description:"Use crisp 2-4px radii for a precise, technical look. Avoid pill shapes except for small status indicators."},{id:"soft",label:"Soft",preview:"8-12px",description:"Use restrained 8-12px radii on cards, inputs, and panels. Keep inner controls slightly tighter than containers."},{id:"rounded",label:"Rounded",preview:"16-24px",description:"Use rounded 16-24px surfaces for a friendly, app-like feel while preserving tight alignment and clear edges."}],Mrs=[{id:"flat-lines",label:"Flat Lines",preview:"Borders",description:"Use mostly flat surfaces with subtle borders and tonal background changes instead of heavy shadows."},{id:"soft-depth",label:"Soft Depth",preview:"Soft",description:"Use soft, tinted shadows and light layering for depth. Keep shadow direction consistent and avoid generic black haze."},{id:"glass-depth",label:"Glass Depth",preview:"Glass",description:"Use translucent layered panels with subtle inner borders, restrained blur, and readable contrast."}],Lrs=[{id:"none",label:"Still",preview:"0ms",description:"Use no decorative motion beyond essential state transitions. Prioritize a calm static layout."},{id:"subtle",label:"Subtle",preview:"150-250ms",description:"Use subtle hover, focus, and reveal transitions with transform and opacity. Keep timing quick and restrained."},{id:"expressive",label:"Expressive",preview:"Scroll",description:"Use tasteful scroll reveals, staggered entrances, and tactile hover motion while preserving readability and performance."}],Frs=[{id:"operational",label:"Operational",preview:"Dense UI",description:"Design like a focused production tool: dense but organized information, quiet controls, and predictable scan paths."},{id:"studio",label:"Studio",preview:"Agency",description:"Design like a premium studio page: confident typography, considered asymmetry, polished imagery, and high visual contrast."},{id:"template-detail",label:"Template Detail",preview:"Preview + Meta",description:"Use a template-detail rhythm with a prominent preview surface, supporting metadata, compact tags, and clear primary actions."},{id:"design-mod