f,p]=A.useState(0),[h,g]=A.useState(!0),x=[{name:"Redwan Uddin",role:"",content:"Aura is the most intuitive vibe coding platform I have used. I've used Figma Make, Base44, Lovable (still good) and Gemini AI Studio. The template and component features, as well as the freedom to make changes in Design mode are so awesome! Also having the ability to download the code, import or export to Figma or publishing to a temporary URL gives me flexibility to adapt depending on my project needs."},{name:"Umut Onan",role:"",content:"Best UI generator out there. Figma export, source code and interactive prototypes all per prompt, great product."},{name:"Faisal @NextHustle",role:"Designer",content:"I've been procrastinating on this design for weeks. Designed it in Aura.build in 2 hours. Shout out to @MengTo for this amazing tool. Indeed but this is the future. I haven't touched Figma during the whole build. Truly amazing."},{name:"Samp Man",role:"Software Engineer",content:"Aura Build is one of the most crazy values I have gotten from AIs. Its an extremely powerful and a unique offering for software engineers who want to focus on quickly iterating on UIs. Its my 3rd day in and it feels like it has unblocked the creative juices for me! Kudos!"},{name:"Martin Goláň",role:"Founder Unload",content:"I tried aura.build with Gemini 3. The workflow is elite. I used it to build the landing page for my new project useunload.com. If you want to get the most out of this combo: Use screenshots as context. Mix & Match references. The speed of iteration is just different now."},{name:"Joyjeet Sarkar",role:"CTO @amoga_io",content:"aura.build is so f**king beautiful. Started your video assuming you are showing how to build using Gemini 3. Understood its about aura.build. Although you didnt mention its a paid service, ended up signing up and the 1 shot UIs are soo freaking beautiful"}],[v,w]=A.useState(0),N=Math.ceil(x.length/3),C=()=>{w(P=>(P+1)%N)},I=()=>{w(P=>(P-1+N)%N)};A.useEffect(()=>(n.curren