version: "alpha"
name: "Untitled Design System"
description: "A reusable visual system for AI-generated interfaces."
colors:
  primary: "#3B82F6"
  background: "#F8FAFC"
  surface: "#111827"
  text-primary: "#FFFFFF"
  text-secondary: "#94A3B8"
  border: "#FFFFFF"
  accent: "#3B82F6"
typography:
  display-lg:
    fontFamily: "Inter"
    fontSize: "56px"
    fontWeight: 600
    lineHeight: "60px"
  body-md:
    fontFamily: "Inter"
    fontSize: "14px"
    fontWeight: 400
    lineHeight: "22px"
  label-md:
    fontFamily: "Inter"
    fontSize: "12px"
    fontWeight: 600
    lineHeight: "16px"
spacing:
  base: "8px"
  gap: "12px"
  card-padding: "24px"
  section-padding: "64px"
rounded:
  md: "12px"
---

## Overview

Describe the visual direction, composition rules, and interaction tone.

## Colors

Explain the palette roles and how AI should use each token.

## Typography

Describe display, body, and label hierarchy.
